{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book","id":1288542,"title":"Lunars you're looking forward to creating with the new book","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-02-16T01:02:44-08:00","id":1288542,"title":"Lunars you're looking forward to creating with the new book","content":"Thousand Fang Shadow: assassin, guerilla, terrorist. His spirit form is a panther. I'm leaning toward Full Moon caste, but he might end up being a No Moon. Intimacies include, but are not limited to: Make the Realm Bleed [hatred], Feel Dragon-Blooded Throats Between Your Jaws [rage]. I'm hoping for some army-training Charms, so he can make use of his War [Asymmetric Warfare] specialization.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1856-hakkonen","name":"Hakkonen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T02:38:20-08:00","id":1288553,"title":"","content":"Maybe I'll get around to statting Kerensky: father of the 20 beastman clans","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T03:13:01-08:00","id":1288558,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hakkonen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book#post1288542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I'm hoping for some army-training Charms, so he can make use of his War [Asymmetric Warfare] specialization.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, those are in the first charm preview.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T03:30:19-08:00","id":1288562,"title":"","content":"I started playing a Lunar recently, but without a lot of support. Luckily, the three sessions I've played her didn't involve any fighting; me and the group's Eclipse were following a Realm spy for 2 sessions, then I missed a session, and then I hung out at the PCs' main base meeting a couple of other PCs, and did some investigation.<br /> So I've been able to get away with a small number of charms so far, but I am looking forward to writing up the character properly.<br /> <br /> <br /> Dr Soma Vraidya is a Casteless snake-totem doctor and master of martial arts.<br /> After her parents died, she sold her share in the family farm and came to the big city, where she trained was trained by the Eight Venom Sisterhood in medicine, poison and Snake style. They healed the sick poor, fought off rival dojos, and sometimes carried out quarantines for the King. But most of them fell in the Realm invasion several years ago. She was independent for a while, then went through a phase as a trainee Immaculate nun, but found the nuns to be hypocrites. She returned home to her brothers' farms, but when Realm soldiers came to levy taxes they couldn't afford, she killed three with pressure point strikes and poisoned the other two with her sudden growth of poisonous fangs.<br /> To protect her family, she went on the run, eventually finding her way to Jyudo Far-Flung, bear-lord of the Tangle. She lived with him for a month, but when Loyal Fox, Eclipse diplomat of a nearby circle of Solars, came to discuss an alliance, Jyudo sent Dr Soma back with her to meet the other Solars.<br /> <br /> So currently she's a Casteless practicioner of Snake Style with a splash of Immaculate martial arts, and the poison and medicine charms from the preview, plus a few others.<br /> My favoured attributes are Dexterity, Manipulation and Intelligence, but I'm not sure which Caste to pick once Jyudo arranges for a No Moon to come do it. I thought I'd wait and see if one Caste has charms that I find more fun than the others.<br /> <br /> Appearance actually looks quite fun from the preview, but that's actually her lowest attribute (3) as we have another Lunar with Appearance 5 in the party. And I'm sure there'll be plenty of fun charms in the other trees.<br /> <br /> <br /> I thought I might find, after the book came out, that I had another really exciting concept, but I didn't want to wait 5-6 sessions before starting playing again, after my Solar died.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T06:15:50-08:00","id":1288585,"title":"","content":"I'm pondering Princess Eiko, a Ladybird Totem that rifs on some of the old Princess in the Tower stories. More western than i normally go in Exalted, gonna look up other variants of the story. Kinda split between Changing and No Moon","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4086-croakamancer","name":"Croakamancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4086_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T07:58:39-08:00","id":1288599,"title":"","content":"The literal combat wombat. A Full Moon with a wombat totem; somewhat inspired by the art of &quot;Rabid Wombats&quot; from old Magic: the Gathering, and somewhat inspired by just the silly name. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12111-the_larz","name":"the_larz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T08:07:40-08:00","id":1288602,"title":"","content":"After seeing (some of) the War Charms, I'm considering an Army Ant Totem general, who's an awe-inspiring war-leader but is also unsettlingly inhuman in aspect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/21733-ascension","name":"Ascension","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar21733_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T10:00:46-08:00","id":1288630,"title":"","content":"The blood brother of my Prasadi Air Aspect, a &quot;guest&quot; of the Pure Way who spends most of his life trying to moderate his Anathemic impulses and trying to be a good Immaculate and moral support of his more Realm-approved brother, a Pasiap's Stair graduate.<br /> <br /> Leaving out, of course, that he sees no paradox between his beliefs and being an adherent of Amatha Kinslayer. To him, the Realm has strayed from its dharma of bringing order to the world with its addiction to slavery, conquest, and lack of respect for other paths (plus how the Pure Way is regarded as a heretical faith, which obviously doesn't sit well with a Pure Way monk). The fact that Injira (the Dragon-Blood) is a rising star among military sorcerers makes him an excellent ally for inserting healthier strains of the Immaculate philosophy into the mainstream, with a hope of causing a schism that turns it against the Realm and/or negotiates with other Lunars rather than Wyld Hunting them as the first, last, and only resort. A task helped by the fact it wasn't actually a plan until Injira revealed he was also skeptical of the Wyld Hunt as a concept; he didn't so much &quot;manipulate&quot; as &quot;convince Injira to forward some Pure Way writings to his soldiers and encourage him to voice his doubts when in a shikari.&quot;<br /> <br /> That, or an abnormally talented &quot;mortal&quot; graduate of the Heptagram, who hides the fact he's a No Moon who deeply resents the very concept of House Ragara behind normal sorcerer weirdness (&quot;Oh! Did you not know a mortal who becomes a sorcerer often develops mutations from Essence beyond their ken? That's why I have portee ivory fur on my ears.&quot;)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","user":"Leliel","date":". 02-16-2019, 02:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T11:15:28-08:00","id":1288648,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>the_larz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book?p=1288599#post1288599\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The literal combat wombat. A Full Moon with a wombat totem; somewhat inspired by the art of &quot;Rabid Wombats&quot; from old Magic: the Gathering, and somewhat inspired by just the silly name. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>A combat wombat you say...<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://diggercomic.com/blog/2007/05/14/digger-105/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://diggercomic.com/wp-content/themes/comicpress-3c/diggerheader.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://diggercomic.com/blog/2007/05/14/digger-105/\" target=\"_blank\"> Digger by Ursula Vernon &raquo; Archive &raquo; Digger </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://diggercomic.com/blog/2007/05/14/digger-105/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://diggercomic.com/blog/2007/05/14/digger-105/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> (Granted Digger is probably more of a No Moon, but she\u2019s not bad in a fight)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T11:34:21-08:00","id":1288657,"title":"","content":"I have many ideas, but I'm going to refine them when I see later chapters of the book and more charms. I really get the feeling there's going to be a lot of charms in this book that make you go &quot;Oh maaaan I need to add that to my idea!&quot; Like, for example, a Lunar who hunts prey from the mirrors of their target's boudoirs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T12:40:25-08:00","id":1288688,"title":"","content":"I want to make a No Moon necromancer, but sadly we are still going to be waiting a bit for necromancy to actually get published (though I guess there is always homebrew). I'll have to wait until all the charms are out to see what I would make based solely on whats in the book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T15:17:35-08:00","id":1288754,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book?p=1288553#post1288553\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe I'll get around to statting Kerensky: father of the 20 beastman clans</div> </div> </div> </div>Watch out for those wolverine-folk, they're bad eggs. Of course, it's the space spiders that'll really kill you...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T15:35:38-08:00","id":1288759,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.games-workshop.com/en-NO/Codex-Genestealer-Cults-hb-2019-eng\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.games-workshop.com/en-NO...ts-hb-2019-eng</a><br /> <br /> I want to make a Lunar cult leader, a dark patriarch leading his flock of oppressed mutants and beastmen against their tormentors. When the time is right, the children of the dark will boil forth from their lairs to drag down the Dragonbloods and their accomplices, and roar their victory into the skies over a mound of their foes' skulls.<br /> <br /> They're not heralds of an intergalactic swarm of locusts, and their fury is <i>very</i> justified; but that doesn't make them <i>nice</i>.<br /> <br /> Edit: This might work better with an Abyssal, but Lunars are coming out first.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T15:59:23-08:00","id":1288768,"title":"","content":"A swarm Lunar. One whose innermost self is a large swarm of insects. I can only imagine what would make a person become that, and I want to play that person.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2176-spectaculartentacular","name":"SpectacularTentacular","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2176_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T16:36:12-08:00","id":1288776,"title":"","content":"I'm still hoping to recreate my monkey-totem martial artist (in the aesthetic vein of Son Goku), so I'm really looking forward to dexterity and wits charms in particular. I'm hoping to be able to do something cool with multiple MA styles (probably a max of 2 given the huge investment, but mixing MA is conceptually cool even if not optimal), lunar attribute charms, and hopefully a cool SSJ4 form<i>-ahem-</i>Deadly Beastman Transformation.<br /> <br /> Conceptually, his schtick is that he believes that, since the First Age, the Exalted Host has repeatedly made the same mistake: creating a world that can't function and survive without them. The Solars created wonders that couldn't be sustained in their absence. The Sidereals and Terrestrials created the Realm that can't be sustained in the Empress' absence. This guy is very focused on teaching martial arts to mortals as a way to elevate their minds and their bodies to allow them to build a Creation that doesn't center around the Exalted.<br /> <br /> He also wants to be the first Lunar to master a Sidereal Martial Art... that's a whole separate story <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> (This will be the recreation of a 2E character. His Motivation was the master an SMA, and all of the other stuff described above built up over the course of a years-long campaign. Hopefully... I actually get a chance to recreate this character.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/415-equitable-remedy","name":"Equitable Remedy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar415_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T19:25:19-08:00","id":1288808,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book?p=1288754#post1288754\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Watch out for those wolverine-folk, they're bad eggs. Of course, it's the space spiders that'll really kill you...</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm more worried about the one Snake tribe ruining everything<br /> <br /> <br /> And what the hell is the Cult of hte Illuminated doing here?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T19:29:05-08:00","id":1288810,"title":"","content":"A kung-fu Elephant.<br /> <br /> Really just a very vague concept I had at one point that stuck with me. I'm not generally into Lunars.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T19:53:34-08:00","id":1288818,"title":"","content":"I really want to play with the idea of a Beastman Lunar whose Spirit Shape is NOT her heritage-animal. I assume her Hybrid form would stack the mutations from her &quot;human&quot; form with her Spirit Shape animal, without the Chimera Charm (because her actual Spirit Shape is still a single animal form). My favorite idea to implement this is a Snakewoman with a Mongoose Spirit Shape, because she became the ultimate incarnation of swift shadowy death!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T20:02:08-08:00","id":1288819,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Equitable Remedy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book?p=1288776#post1288776\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm still hoping to recreate my monkey-totem martial artist (in the aesthetic vein of Son Goku), so I'm really looking forward to dexterity and wits charms in particular. I'm hoping to be able to do something cool with multiple MA styles (probably a max of 2 given the huge investment, but mixing MA is conceptually cool even if not optimal), lunar attribute charms, and hopefully a cool SSJ4 form<i>-ahem-</i>Deadly Beastman Transformation.<br /> <br /> Conceptually, his schtick is that he believes that, since the First Age, the Exalted Host has repeatedly made the same mistake: creating a world that can't function and survive without them. The Solars created wonders that couldn't be sustained in their absence. The Sidereals and Terrestrials created the Realm that can't be sustained in the Empress' absence. This guy is very focused on teaching martial arts to mortals as a way to elevate their minds and their bodies to allow them to build a Creation that doesn't center around the Exalted.<br /> <br /> He also wants to be the first Lunar to master a Sidereal Martial Art... that's a whole separate story <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> (This will be the recreation of a 2E character. His Motivation was the master an SMA, and all of the other stuff described above built up over the course of a years-long campaign. Hopefully... I actually get a chance to recreate this character.)</div> </div> </div> </div>It'll be a long wait, but 3E Monkey Style will <i>probably</i> be coming in the Many-Faced Strangers companion book thanks to an upcoming stretch goal.<br /> <br /> (Along with Toad Style! I'm <i>so</i> excited for that one.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/21733-ascension","name":"Ascension","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar21733_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T20:48:28-08:00","id":1288831,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book?p=1288808#post1288808\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm more worried about the one Snake tribe ruining everything<br /> <br /> <br /> And what the hell is the Cult of hte Illuminated doing here?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's those dastardly wolverines - the bears are sure of it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-16T21:03:58-08:00","id":1288833,"title":"","content":"Actually, I've always wanted to play someone who can incant this, and mean it:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <i>I am the very model of a sorcerer Celestial,<br /> I've studied Workings, demons, gods both Heaven's and Terrestrial,<br /> I'm quite good at summoning (be of spirits or the infernal) because I am enlightened (which I know is not at all humble),<br /> My powers and my studies range from eldritch to the practical, I am the very model of a sorcerer Celestial.</i><br /> <br /> Here's to you, Mordin Solus.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","user":"Leliel","date":". 02-17-2019, 12:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-17T01:29:56-08:00","id":1288874,"title":"","content":"Years ago, when Ex3 came out, before Arms of the Chosen was released, when people were talking about Ex3 Lunars getting a much-needed fix, I made myself a promise.<br /> <br /> I would make Morgiana from Magi as a Full Moon Lunar.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://vignette.wikia.nocookie.net/magi/images/e/e1/Morgiana_Current.png/revision/latest?cb=20161025220049\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I said to myself if I couldn't make her as a Lunar and make her feel FUN... Not even &quot;Stronger or as strong as a Solar&quot;, just &quot;Mechanically viable to the point where I don't feel like she's useless&quot;, I'd consider Lunars 0 for 3.<br /> <br /> Well, the Kickstarter is up. We have some Preview Charms.<br /> <br /> I think that she's going to be fun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-17T01:45:55-08:00","id":1288877,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book?p=1288874#post1288874\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Years ago, when Ex3 came out, before Arms of the Chosen was released, when people were talking about Ex3 Lunars getting a much-needed fix, I made myself a promise.<br /> <br /> I would make Morgiana from Magi as a Full Moon Lunar.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://vignette.wikia.nocookie.net/magi/images/e/e1/Morgiana_Current.png/revision/latest?cb=20161025220049\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I said to myself if I couldn't make her as a Lunar and make her feel FUN... Not even &quot;Stronger or as strong as a Solar&quot;, just &quot;Mechanically viable to the point where I don't feel like she's useless&quot;, I'd consider Lunars 0 for 3.<br /> <br /> Well, the Kickstarter is up. We have some Preview Charms.<br /> <br /> I think that she's going to be fun.</div> </div> </div> </div>Weren't the Finalis basically just giant lion-wolves with steel plates for skin? (When they weren't Human, that is) That seems pretty easy to do for a Chimeric Spirit Shape!<br /> <br /> I'm basic and boring, I just wanted to make a mentor of an old Lunar character of mine, the Thousand Poison spitting Toad Demon of the Eastern Swamps. (The basic idea was that Amphibians don't stop growing throughout their lives, I wondered what the Spirit Shape of one that had lived 2000 years looked like).<br /> <br /> So:<br /> - Giant Toad/Man/Crochety Old Yoda-Sensei (amusingly, his human shape would be on the small side)<br /> - Toad Style Martial Arts (poison everything)<br /> <br /> prototype00<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-17T02:17:55-08:00","id":1288881,"title":"","content":"I'm currently in a position where the only Lunars I'm going to be able to make are NPCs so I can't spoil.<br /> <br /> But! A friend of mine working on the book asked what I wanted and among other things, I showed them this.<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1gCRt9XGJDs\" data-code=\"1gCRt9XGJDs\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/1gCRt9XGJDs/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> So I'm very optimistic for Lunar Strength. Also terrified.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":7,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","user":"Lioness","date":". 02-17-2019, 05:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-17T11:31:35-08:00","id":1288959,"title":"","content":"On that note, I want to design a Lunar Dragon.<br /> <br /> If the Wyld Hunt are the holy knights hunting the devil into its own den, then they deserve a Lernean Hydra, a Fafnir, a Smaug, an Alduin terrible enough to be the dragon of their story.<br /> <br /> Trogdar the Burninator, burninating the peasants to draw attention, and then the holy warriors who arrive to stop him. An absolute monster.<br /> <br /> Psychotic, envious, jealous. Monomaniacally obsessed with proving himself the \u201ctrue\u201d dragon, and opposed to the Realm simply because it is the biggest rival dragon around.<br /> <br /> If valid spirit shapes and chimerism aren\u2019t enough to gain a dragon as a totem, then this madman resorted to sorcerous self-modification.<br /> <br /> If he was a Dynast who failed to Exalt, he might seek to master all five Immaculate Styles, but odds are that he specializes in fighting in various bestial forms. Dinosaurs, mostly, to express as many different forms of \u201cdragon\u201d as possible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-17T11:34:35-08:00","id":1288960,"title":"","content":"At first I wanted to make a Raiton-themed Lunar to maybe the be the Man-Bat to my Solar Knight Raiton, but I don't know, a lot of these previewed Appearance Charms are putting me in a Catwoman mood..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-17T13:58:26-08:00","id":1288991,"title":"","content":"Reading through all these social charms made me realize a <b>Lunar Yandere gf </b>would be one of the most transcendentally terrifying things you could throw at a Solar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1311230-badassoverlord-s-assorted-homebrew-folder\" target=\"_blank\">Are you in the market for some Martial Arts? Perhaps some custom Artifacts for your campaign?</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10131-badassoverlord","name":"BadassOverlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10131_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-17T15:19:48-08:00","id":1289015,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BadassOverlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book?p=1288991#post1288991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Reading through all these social charms made me realize a <b>Lunar Yandere gf </b>would be one of the most transcendentally terrifying things you could throw at a Solar.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Dynast: So, let me get this straight. A Solar Anathema <i>joined the Wyld Hunt!?</i><br /> <br /> Immaculate Monk: In service of the Dragons, all may find redemption...especially if one is concerned for the sake of a future reincarnation...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-18T07:17:43-08:00","id":1289175,"title":"","content":"Robert Vance confirmed that you can cheese Chimera Soul Expression to get more mutation points for your Spirit Shape and Hybrid Forms without changing your look very much.<br /> <br /> So you could do something as cheesy as picking two subspecies of canine or cat or bird to get a super-canine or super-cat or super-bird form.<br /> <br /> Remember how in Sam Raimi's <i>Spider-Man</i>, the spider that bit Peter Parker was a genetic hybrid of various species, including complex web-weaving spiders and mobile jumping spiders? You can do something like that. Maybe combine a constrictor snake with a venomous snake, or a whale with a dolphin, or a whale with a shark...<br /> <br /> I figure that combining a Tyrant Lizard with a pterodactyl-like species, one way or the other, would let you create various wyvern-type dragons with fully-functional wings (in place of the useless little arms) and crushing jaws.<br /> <br /> Cross a Tyrant Lizard with a feathered bird for a feathered dragon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T07:10:33-08:00","id":1289508,"title":"","content":"Cross an ostrich with a chicken, get a Chocobo Totem.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T07:19:19-08:00","id":1289514,"title":"","content":"I had a Casteless Lunar with an Owl totem.<br /> <br /> He left the group to go join the Silver Pact and get tattooed (after getting amnesia; this was 2nd ed and he kept shapeshifting without tattoos).<br /> <br /> Maybe he can come back with an Owlbear totem!<br /> <br /> (Though I'd have to ask the ST if that's okay... Bear that goes Owl chimera is way, way, way mechanically better than Owl that goes Bear totem.)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T10:13:31-08:00","id":1289577,"title":"","content":"After reading the castes, I kind of want to see Magilou from Tales of Berseria as a No Moon now.<br /> <br /> Yeah, she <i>acts</i> like a cartoon character, but it's not exactly hard to see the cunning trickster and master of the arcane beneath her stage magician persona. It's only revealed later how <i>mythological </i>a trickster she is; Loki in a dress and with the moral of the story on her side.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T10:52:51-08:00","id":1289585,"title":"","content":"Hummingbird Changing Moon General who is a great strategist, inspirational leader.<br /> <br /> Sparrow Casteless Immaculate Monk who has to deal with all the baggage that his religious upbringing entails.<br /> <br /> Cat Full Moon Lunar who lives in the shadows of the Imperial City<br /> <br /> A port of my Fenrir Theurge as a No-Moon. Not sure what animal his spirit shape would be. Not wolf. Probably bat or Merlin. He will have a solar bond with an Midnight Abyssal, which is a port of the Thuerge's BSD half brother.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T11:31:44-08:00","id":1289598,"title":"","content":"I've got three right now:<br /> First, a Changing Moon Swan totem who doesn't really shift to animal form much, but is a graceful duelist (Dexterity Favored) and socialite that wields a moonsilver needle daiklave<br /> <br /> Second, is a Macaw/Tyrant Lizard Chimera Full Moon. Yes, their totem is basically a giant, brightly colored feathered dragon. Strength/Stamina Caste, Appearance-Favored.<br /> <br /> And third is a character based on this:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=567\" data-tempid=\"temp_567_1550604422562_898\" /><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1897-ffanxii4ever","name":"ffanxii4ever","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"109"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T16:10:36-08:00","id":1289685,"title":"","content":"Outside of remaking my 2E Lunar (a Charming Prince type Full Moon with a shark totem), I'm also looking forward to making making a Hellboar Lunar who can be pretty much summed up with this picture.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"https://meme.xyz/uploads/posts/t/l-29663-man-literally-too-angry-to-die.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23912-scottsman","name":"Scottsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-23T18:35:02-08:00","id":1291349,"title":"","content":"I want to make a Lunar who goes on a sacred hunt to get an Ankylosaurus shape. The idea of playing an Ankylosaur in a sword and sorcery setting is too awesome.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, a Giant kittycat. Just because of that one piece of art.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2176-spectaculartentacular","name":"SpectacularTentacular","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2176_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-23T22:49:59-08:00","id":1291433,"title":"","content":"Back in First Edition, I got roped into designing a character for a Heroic Mortal game by a friend who was an obsessive Werewolf: the Apocalypse fan. That was Tain, a Marukani sellsword working for the Haltan military on contract. When the character got shoved into a Lunar exaltation in spite of me saying at the outset that he was best suited as a Dawn caste. I was completely dumbfounded trying to come up with a Spirit Shape. I asked for Tyrant Lizard because I liked the idea of a T-Rex's stoic silence contrasting with its power and fury. I got told that wasn't allowed, and I'd have to settle for alligator. <br /> <br /> In second edition, I revamped Tain as a Solar, and he worked pretty well. <br /> <br /> This time, I'm bringing him back to Lunars, and he's getting his goddamned T-Rex spirit shape because it is explicitly allowed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11867-caffeine-delusions","name":"Caffeine Delusions","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11867_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-06T06:10:26-08:00","id":1294375,"title":"","content":"Reviving:<br /> <br /> I kind of want to make a bat-totem necromancer Lunar who invokes every gothic vampire stereotype known to man. Especially he using his blood to turn a bunch of people into lesser &quot;vampires,&quot; in reality an enormous army of batfolk. <br /> <br /> He's also quite possibly one of the nicest guys you'd ever want to meet, and evokes the image because it scares away would-be monster hunters, and makes the Wyld Hunt think he's blood-obsessed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-07T05:10:35-08:00","id":1294680,"title":"","content":"I've got the foundations of my next character that started forming last night.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/1200x/28/17/99/281799912f148e90b83c413000448fd9.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div> What I have so far: A Changing Moon Parrot Totem stage actress who got into trouble for a satirical take on the founder of the Great House that her homeland is a Satrapy of (anyone but Mnemon really, my last Changing Moon and her had a special relationship). She's quite possibly the most annoying thing alive when she really wants to be.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-07T05:21:23-08:00","id":1294682,"title":"","content":"The character sounds fun but that picture is gorgeous, by the way","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25050-fodor","name":"FODOR","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-07T05:31:39-08:00","id":1294685,"title":"","content":"Image source <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/lerastyajkina/art/Egyptian-godess-687150174\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-07T08:29:23-08:00","id":1294752,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book?p=1294685#post1294685\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Image source <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/lerastyajkina/art/Egyptian-godess-687150174\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div>I love KittyEmpress' avatar for a Parot-totem Lunar; the artist produced at least one other picture of the character, too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-12T01:07:10-07:00","id":1296067,"title":"","content":"With what has been revealed in the previews so far, I have created a powerful Rhino-themed Full Moon with an arm made of Moonsilver (similar to Arete from Arms of the Chosen [pg 118]). Still trying to decide on a Tell for this character... anyone have suggestions?<br /> <br /> Of course, this is just with the unfinished manuscript previews... once the book is in its final form I will of course refine the character I have created. Hopefully by that time, I will have thought of a Tell for this character.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are three types of people in the world... those who can count and those who can't.<br /> I reject your reality and substitute my own!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","name":"Shadowstripe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2243_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-12T03:35:44-07:00","id":1296083,"title":"","content":"There's a recurring kinda-sorta character that I have that's a vaguely humanoid being with no arms, a ton of head-tentacles, and many big creepy eyes, something halfway between Lovecraft and the weirder bosses in Legend of Zelda.<br /> Well, not only it turns out the general concept is very doable as a hybrid shape, thanks to a lot of freedom being given for aesthetics, but it's the perfect excuse to take all of the grapple-related mutations/charms and have fun with it, having so far never made a grappling-focused character in Ex3.<br /> I don't even care if most of the eyes have to be moonsilver tattoos, that's just an added layer of cool to add whenever they all start appearing.<br /> Just need to work on the more human aspect of this Lunar, which will be best done when I can use her in a game anyway, and I'm set. Python-totem No Moon, gooooooo","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-16T02:46:08-07:00","id":1297185,"title":"","content":"I've got a couple of characters from other games that I'd like to convert:<br /> <br /> Khaas Finds-the-Prey, rakashan scout (Savage Worlds setting The Last Parsec) becomes a Full Moon leopard-totem (maybe cheetah-totem) scout/tracker.<br /> <br /> Taicho Nightfeather, tengu ninja (Pathfinder) becomes a Full Moon raven-totem infiltrator and assassin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1856-hakkonen","name":"Hakkonen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-22T06:30:14-07:00","id":1298575,"title":"","content":"Butterfly totem trickster-mystic, lots of swarm charms and charms focused on themes of metamorphosis, like Sharing Luna's Gifts. Definitely a sorceress, probably a little bit mad, might as well give her Weirdflame. Beautiful, erratic, transcendent, terrifying. Can't decide if she should be Casteless, Changing Moon, or No Moon. Out to punish the &quot;wicked&quot; and reshape the world into something more &quot;beautiful&quot; according to an aesthetic which gets steadily more deranged the more Limit she has.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Measure of Hope is right about everything.&quot; - Wise Old Guru<br /> <br /> Currently running an Exalted 2.5 Abyssals game in a homebrew modern shard because I value neither my time or my sanity, and I'm loving almost every minute of it.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23907-measure-of-hope","name":"Measure of Hope","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"190"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-22T13:21:25-07:00","id":1298726,"title":"","content":"So some additional thought I've had on my Changing Moon. I remember reading somewhere that some Dynasts have started to hunt slaves dressed like the Scarlet Empress so I could see them putting her through that instead of having her executed or sold into slavery out of a sense of poetic irony and calling it the role of a lifetime.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-22T20:02:19-07:00","id":1298831,"title":"","content":"I'm currently working on a Lunar whose spirit shape isn't a natural animal but instead Gorgon from Arms of the Chosen. The idea is that whatever her normal spirit shape was going to be got eaten when she got stabbed by the sword. Because of this, she's terrified of taking Sacred hunts and has become very lethargic due to the Spirit Shape's influence. Since she was soldier but unwillingly before, she's become very unwilling to raise her sword to causes she doesn't really believe in, but her mentor is Sha'a Oka, who fished her out of the ocean out of her Exaltation and is trying to help her control her spirit shape. While he wants to use her to finish taking the Caul, she's uncertain if she wants to do that and is resisting it and focusing on trying to control her spirit shape so it doesn't break out. I want to play her as full Strength/Stamina/Appearance full moon, with low Wits and Awareness; the idea that she's so lethargic and rather narcoleptic, so she is slow to respond but also almost impossible to hurt.<br /> <br /> Since this'll be the first time I've gotten to play a character really starting from 0 in a new game in a long time I'm excited to get the chance to have a character whose working towards managing goals rather then feeling like I'm coming in having to already have some stuff laid out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">https://swordofcreation.net/</a> : A secondary forum focusing on archiving homebrew, both mechanical and fluff, and receiving critique on it.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/108-flare","name":"Flare","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar108_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-23T02:37:02-07:00","id":1298883,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book?p=1298726#post1298726\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I remember reading somewhere that some Dynasts have started to hunt slaves dressed like the Scarlet Empress</div> </div> </div> </div>What?!?<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">10char</span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12943-handigar","name":"Handigar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-23T03:35:23-07:00","id":1298899,"title":"","content":"^what he said","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-23T04:11:28-07:00","id":1298902,"title":"","content":"I'm unable to locate a source for this at present, but I'm pretty sure it was something the previous editions threw out as an example of Dragon-Blooded depravity. Wherever its from the imagery of a young woman being dressed as the Scarlet Empress and then forced to flee for her life is evocative enough that I'm stealing it for a backstory.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-23T04:14:01-07:00","id":1298905,"title":"","content":"It sounds familiar, tbh.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-23T04:32:08-07:00","id":1298908,"title":"","content":"I wouldn\u2019t use it as something \u201cDynasts\u201d do, as in it\u2019s becoming a social past time - but one particular Dynast being the setting\u2019s Ramses Snow seems viable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-23T04:45:00-07:00","id":1298912,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book?p=1298902#post1298902\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm unable to locate a source for this at present, but I'm pretty sure it was something the previous editions threw out as an example of Dragon-Blooded depravity. Wherever its from the imagery of a young woman being dressed as the Scarlet Empress and then forced to flee for her life is evocative enough that I'm stealing it for a backstory.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think this whole thing goes back to a line about the Slug character and some party he arranged. And I think it was the 1st edition Wood book. Sorry I remember he is Seuss but can't remember his full name.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/293-lncbill","name":"lncbill","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-24T09:36:49-07:00","id":1299246,"title":"","content":"I can't believe I didn't have this idea before:<br /> <br /> A Nexus street rat who was lucky enough to be the reincarnation of a First Age shaman-technician and thus had an instinctive understanding of Artifacts and minor wonders she used to become the leader of the most competent cat burglars in the city, only to be targeted as prime slave-agent material by the Guild; she Exalted and escaped as a white-furred rat, reunited with her gang and made them into ratfolk with a new mission - to spread across Creation and gnaw the Guild's heart out!<br /> <br /> If you want to know why I feel ashamed I didn't think of it, I'll give you three hints:<br /> <br /> 1) She likes building bases underground and her standard offered mutation package involves digging claws.<br /> <br /> 2) She's obsessed with tech and mass-produced devices, especially firewands.<br /> <br /> 3) Thanks to Nexus thief's cant, a favorite insult of hers is calling people who are just her marks &quot;things&quot; (as in, &quot;die, Realm-things!&quot;).<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">The punchline is that she's way more like actual rats than her inspiration. Which is to say, one of the few animals scientifically proven to have altruism.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","user":"Leliel","date":". 03-24-2019, 03:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-24T19:54:58-07:00","id":1299496,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book?p=1298902#post1298902\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm unable to locate a source for this at present, but I'm pretty sure it was something the previous editions threw out as an example of Dragon-Blooded depravity. Wherever its from the imagery of a young woman being dressed as the Scarlet Empress and then forced to flee for her life is evocative enough that I'm stealing it for a backstory.</div> </div> </div> </div>Manacle and Coin, page 82.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T05:56:13-07:00","id":1299566,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book?p=1299496#post1299496\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Manacle and Coin, page 82.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lncbill</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book?p=1298912#post1298912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think this whole thing goes back to a line about the Slug character and some party he arranged. And I think it was the 1st edition Wood book. Sorry I remember he is Seuss but can't remember his full name.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Slug is a secret patriot, I could see him using a hunt like that to arrange an unfortunate 'accident' for one of his guests.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book?p=1298908#post1298908\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wouldn\u2019t use it as something \u201cDynasts\u201d do, as in it\u2019s becoming a social past time - but one particular Dynast being the setting\u2019s Ramses Snow seems viable.</div> </div> </div> </div> Turns out its Cynis! I wish I was shocked but they really were a lot of moments in 1st and 2nd edition where they come across as an entire family of Ramsay Boltons.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T09:51:29-07:00","id":1299630,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book?p=1298908#post1298908\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wouldn\u2019t use it as something \u201cDynasts\u201d do, as in it\u2019s becoming a social past time - but one particular Dynast being the setting\u2019s Ramses Snow seems viable.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm torn, because I've been thinking a lot lately about the significance of the Scarlet Dynasty as something systemic in which a lot of bad practices pervade and are enabled throughout even if not actively participated in by everyone.<br /> <br /> I'm wary of any sentiments that would lean in the direction of &quot;there are good Dynasts and there are bad Dynasts, and the bad ones just happen to have more authority&quot;, or even flirt coyly with it from across the room.<br /> <br /> But not quite in the manner of expressing discontent with the monarchy by hunting slaves for sport.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T00:57:40-07:00","id":1299878,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book?p=1299630#post1299630\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm torn, because I've been thinking a lot lately about the significance of the Scarlet Dynasty as something systemic in which a lot of bad practices pervade and are enabled throughout even if not actively participated in by everyone.<br /> <br /> I'm wary of any sentiments that would lean in the direction of &quot;there are good Dynasts and there are bad Dynasts, and the bad ones just happen to have more authority&quot;, or even flirt coyly with it from across the room.<br /> <br /> But not quite in the manner of expressing discontent with the monarchy by hunting slaves for sport.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm kind of reminded of the whole business with police conveniently not having their body cams turned on, not tracking how many people they kill, being encouraged by their own chiefs to erase bad marks off their records, and so on; sure, not every cop is bad, but the system <i>as a whole...</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 03-26-2019, 04:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T02:44:48-07:00","id":1299890,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book?p=1299630#post1299630\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm torn, because I've been thinking a lot lately about the significance of the Scarlet Dynasty as something systemic in which a lot of bad practices pervade and are enabled throughout even if not actively participated in by everyone.<br /> <br /> I'm wary of any sentiments that would lean in the direction of &quot;there are good Dynasts and there are bad Dynasts, and the bad ones just happen to have more authority&quot;, or even flirt coyly with it from across the room.<br /> <br /> But not quite in the manner of expressing discontent with the monarchy by hunting slaves for sport.</div> </div> </div> </div>For me it\u2019s the difference between the broader American chattel slave system and Delphine LaLaurie. Both are absolutely evil, but one is a pragmatic system of exploitation for profit, and the other is pure sadism as an emotional outlet at great personal expense. The former wasn\u2019t less evil, but it is a different animal from the latter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T03:50:43-07:00","id":1299897,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book?p=1299246#post1299246\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can't believe I didn't have this idea before:<br /> <br /> A Nexus street rat who was lucky enough to be the reincarnation of a First Age shaman-technician and thus had an instinctive understanding of Artifacts and minor wonders she used to become the leader of the most competent cat burglars in the city, only to be targeted as prime slave-agent material by the Guild; she Exalted and escaped as a white-furred rat, reunited with her gang and made them into ratfolk with a new mission - to spread across Creation and gnaw the Guild's heart out!<br /> <br /> If you want to know why I feel ashamed I didn't think of it, I'll give you three hints:<br /> <br /> 1) She likes building bases underground and her standard offered mutation package involves digging claws.<br /> <br /> 2) She's obsessed with tech and mass-produced devices, especially firewands.<br /> <br /> 3) Thanks to Nexus thief's cant, a favorite insult of hers is calling people who are just her marks &quot;things&quot; (as in, &quot;die, Realm-things!&quot;).<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">The punchline is that she's way more like actual rats than her inspiration. Which is to say, one of the few animals scientifically proven to have altruism.</div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>This is refference to something . Please, enlighten me as to what that is, so I may enjoy it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T05:33:18-07:00","id":1299918,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1288542-lunars-you-re-looking-forward-to-creating-with-the-new-book?p=1299897#post1299897\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This is refference to something . Please, enlighten me as to what that is, so I may enjoy it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Allow me to introduce you to the Skaven:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"https://1d4chan.org/images/thumb/3/30/Capture131114532.png/350px-Capture131114532.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Behold, the most twisted faction in Warhammer Fantasy, and their competition involves cults of primal gods of evil. They actually come off as rather funny, since they lack any and all virtues, up to and including care for if their various inventions will explode or any real bravery. That same lack of care also gives them WWI level tech in a early Enlightenment setting.<br /> <br /> Also known for their distinct accent: &quot;Man-things weak will die-die quick-soon!&quot;</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avata